Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 08:21:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs: describe BF63112

Add a documentation stub for the BF63112 SPI driver: device identity, the
recovered selector and frame layout, the operations the driver implements,
the safety rule that no write opcode is allowlisted, and the remaining
unknowns (no hardware transcript, unread _CRS, inferred field layouts,
polling interrupt, undecoded enrol/verify payloads).

libfprint has no per-driver documentation convention, so this is a standalone
page under doc/drivers/; the text can move into the manual if the maintainers
prefer another place.
